  "prefLabel": "He-E 806.30 Audit Procedures",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-E 806.30 Audit Procedures. The following auditing procedures shall apply:\n\n(a) The department shall conduct on-site audits of the financial and statistical records of participating NFs, pursuant to the requirements of 42 CFR 447.202 and 42 CFR 447.253(g);\n\n(b) The on-site audits as described in (a) above shall be performed to ascertain whether the cost report submitted by the NF meets the requirements as outlined in He-E 806; and\n\n(c) For out-of-state NFs, the department shall accept the audit findings and adjustments of out-of-state medicaid agencies developed in conjunction with their respective cost-related reimbursement plans.\n\nSource. #8547, eff 1-24-06 (formerly He-W 593.07); ss by #10474, eff 1-24-14; ss by #14020, eff 7-10-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-e800.html"
